{"title": "Within the Mind Sanctuary (Condition)", "pageid": 20563, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Within the Mind Sanctuary</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can take actions and bonus actions interchangeably, as long as it stays within the mind sanctuary.</li>\n<li>After using both action and bonus action, this condition ends and you gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\">Mind Sanctuary: Depleted</a> condition. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TAD_MIND_SANCTUARY</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTAD_MIND_SANCTUARY%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTAD_MIND_SANCTUARY%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 1\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Honour_mode\">Honour mode</span></h2>\n<p>In Honour Mode, Within the Mind Sanctuary instead grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hastened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Hastened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hastened_(Condition)\" title=\"Hastened (Condition)\">Hastened</a> and prevents other sources of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slowed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Slowed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slowed_(Condition)\" title=\"Slowed (Condition)\">Slowed</a> or Hastened from affecting creatures within it.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary\">Sources of Within the Mind Sanctuary</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary_(area)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary (area)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Mind_Sanctuary_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary_(area)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary (area)\">Mind Sanctuary</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>TAD_MIND_SANCTUARY</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\">Mind Sanctuary: Depleted</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You cannot benefit more from Mind Sanctuary this turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Within the Mind Sanctuary</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can take actions and bonus actions interchangeably, as long as it stays within the mind sanctuary.</li>\n<li>After using both action and bonus action, this condition ends and you gain the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\">Mind Sanctuary: Depleted</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715171227\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2758/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35565/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10403/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1306093/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.453      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   66.453      1 -total\n 62.78%   41.716      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.65%   17.710      3 Template:Cond\n 23.49%   15.609      9 Template:Icon_link\n 22.32%   14.830      9 Template:Icon_text\n 19.07%   12.671      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 18.46%   12.270     27 Template:Trim\n 16.30%   10.829      5 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 11.30%    7.511      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20563-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715171227 and revision id 343175. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}